        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur ARCBEL19ENTR, Keyed Entry Bellagio Lever with Arc Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bellagio Keyed Entry Lever with Arc Tall Plate is a wonderful pairing of traditional elements to make a classic front door lock that seems timeless. Its elegance is accentuated through the flow of the wave Bellagio Leverset that is mirrored in the arch of the Arc Tall Plate. This Keyed Entry Bellagio Lever with Arc is a single cylinder lock. It is easy to install and will fit most standard pre-drilled doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A lever operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWant your entire house to have matching hardware? Also Available <a href=\"/products/bellagio-lever-with-arc-tall-plate-grandeur-arcbel19\"><b>Bellagio Lever with Arc Tall Plate for Interior Doors</b></a> in Privacy, Passage, and Dummy Functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Single Cylinder Grandeur Bellagio Lever with Arc Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Entry Set Bellagio Leverset with Arc Tall Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4.72\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 1.90\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-ARCBEL19ENTR-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262396\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur ARCBEL19ENTR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
